description: Block live secrets, signing material, and absolute sample paths
alwaysApply: true
---

# IP protection

- Never print a full license key, `sk_live_`, `whsec_`, or a private key. Redact to the first 4 and last 4 characters.
- Never commit an absolute sample-library path (`/Users/.../Samples`, `C:\Users\...\Samples`). Use a repo-relative path or an env var named in `.env.example` only.
- Stripe MCP is read-only unless the user confirms a write. License minting stays in the website webhook, not in the agent.
- `.cursor/hooks/scan-secrets.py` records a violation after an edit. `.cursor/hooks/guard-shell.py` refuses `rm -rf` of kit masters and a force-push to main.
- Docs may name an env var. Source may not contain a live value.
